ese are selected.\n\nCase 1: No multi-element rows selected. Then we must pick one row for each element from singletons: For 0: choose E or G (2 options). For 1: choose J (only J) because I is multi. So 1 option. For 2: choose C or D (2 options). For 3: choose A (only A). For 4: choose F or K (2 options). Total combos: 2*1*2*1*2 = 8.\n\nCase 2: Exactly one multi-element row selected.\n\nSubcase 2a: Select B (2,3). Then elements 2 and 3 are covered. Remaining elements: 0,1,4. For 0: choose E or G (2). For 1: choose J (1). For 4: choose F or K (2). Also need to ensure no other row covers 2 or 3. Since we selected B, we cannot select any other row that contains 2 or 3. Which rows contain 2 or 3? B itself, C, D"}}],"created":1790944700,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4185,"total_tokens":4953,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-6ihkkSITKbcY52BFU7WvYoFxueHKcdaX","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4185,"prompt_ms":542.501,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12962986857825567,"prompt_per_second":7714.271494430425,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2552.837,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.3283402868318124,"predicted_per_second":300.45004831879197}}